  "notes": "USAGE: Both scientific and business/economic contexts are common. The concept of reaching maximum capacity applies to various fields.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {飽和|ほうわ}{状態|じょうたい} (state of saturation)\n- {飽和|ほうわ}{水溶液|すいようえき} (saturated solution)\n- {飽和|ほうわ}{脂肪酸|しぼうさん} (saturated fatty acid)\n- {市場|しじょう}が{飽和|ほうわ}する (market becomes saturated)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {過飽和|かほうわ} (supersaturation)\n- {不飽和|ふほうわ} (unsaturated)\n- {満杯|まんぱい} (full to capacity - casual)",
